FjeE9Vb01rdER3d3VKVzBpbmFPWHJ1eXZVVjZtUU9LMGtpUHUtQ2EyUA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-20","zh":""},{"title":"Report – WWE Not Extending Saudi Arabia Deal?","src":"eWrestlingNews.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPa1Q3b2FXVkNiU0NPUGo5NHVUTHZYWDRXSGF0d0Q0T3E0ZlFnQkxmcTNiU3lzaVZhbUc3RHd1Rm45MXhaNUxYVnhFOU9JUG9lMGhXYUVMcVlMUGh1cHUyemQxWjk3Q3c3eXlHMmxZWVAwaDk2RXZFMHgwSmdyaUdPQVEzTng1S1AzdUE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-20","zh":""},{"title":"Should Saudi Event Risk Require Action From TKO Stock Investors?","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"沙烏地阿拉伯事件風險是否需要 TKO 股票投資者採取行動？"},{"title":"TKO Group Holdings (TKO) Raises Guidance, Is The Discount To Fair Value Warranted?","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-15","zh":"TKO集團控股（TKO）提出指引，公允價值的折扣是否合理？"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":7},{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1973266/000119312526071651/tko-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"TKO is a premium sports and entertainment company. TKO's businesses include UFC, the world's premier mixed martial arts (\"MMA\") organization; WWE, the global leader in sports entertainment; Professional Bull Riders (\"PBR\"), the world's premier bull riding organization; and its joint venture Zuffa Boxing, a professional boxing promotion. Together, these properties reach more than 1 billion households across 210 countries and territories and organize more than 500 live events year-round, attracting more than three million fans. TKO also services and partners with major sports rights holders through IMG, an industry-leading global sports marketing agency; and On Location, a global leader in premium experiential hospitality.","zh":"TKO 是一家優質運動和娛樂公司。 TKO 的業務包括全球首屈一指的綜合格鬥 (MMA) 組織 UFC； WWE，全球體育娛樂領域的領導者；職業鬥牛協會（“PBR”），世界首屈一指的鬥牛組織；及其合資企業 Zuffa Boxing，一家專業拳擊推廣公司。這些資產總計涵蓋 210 個國家和地區的超過 10 億個家庭，全年舉辦 500 多場現場活動，吸引了超過 300 萬粉絲。 TKO 還透過業界領先的全球體育行銷機構 IMG 為主要體育賽事轉播權持有者提供服務並與其合作； On Location，全球優質體驗式酒店領導者。"},{"en":"TKO was initially established through the combination of UFC and WWE in September 2023. The combination of these two businesses united two complementary sports and sports entertainment properties in a single company. We significantly expanded our portfolio on February 28, 2025, when we completed the Endeavor Asset Acquisition, pursuant to which we acquired the IMG business, including certain businesses operating under the IMG brand, On Location, and PBR (collectively, the \"Acquired Businesses\") from EGH and its subsidiaries. The transaction was valued at approximately $3.25 billion plus a $50 million purchase price adjustment (based on the volume-weighted average sales price of TKO's Class A common stock for the twenty-five trading days ending on October 23, 2024), and was satisfied through the issuance of 26.54 million common units of TKO OpCo and an equivalent number of corresponding s","zh":"TKO 最初是由 UFC 和 WWE 於 2023 年 9 月合併而成。這兩家企業的合併將兩個互補的體育和體育娛樂產業合併在一家公司中。 2025 年 2 月 28 日，我們完成了 Endeavor 資產收購，大幅擴大了我們的投資組合，據此，我們從 EGH 及其子公司收購了 IMG 業務，包括以 IMG 品牌、On Location 和 PBR 經營的某些業務（統稱為「被收購業務」）。該交易價值約 32.5 億美元，加上 5,000 萬美元的購買價格調整（基於截至 2024 年 10 月 23 日的 25 個交易日 TKO A 類普通股的成交量加權平均銷售價格），並透過發行 2,654 萬股 TKO OpCo 普通單位和成交量加權平均銷售的數量來滿足同等數量。"},{"en":"We believe TKO's businesses are well-positioned among sports, media and entertainment peers given our comprehensive portfolio of premium intellectual property, global media distribution capabilities, and experiential offerings. The addition of IMG, a global leader in sports, events, and media, and On Location, a premium experiential hospitality provider for marquee global events, significantly expands our engagement with our global fanbase. Finally, PBR provides us with additional live event programming and media content. In total, our combined portfolio allows us to engage fans across the entire sports ecosystem, from media consumption to premium live event experiences.","zh":"我們相信，鑑於我們全面的優質智慧財​​產權、全球媒體發行能力和體驗產品組合，TKO 的業務在體育、媒體和娛樂同行中處於有利地位。 IMG（體育、賽事和媒體領域的全球領導者）和 On Location（一家為大型全球活動提供優質體驗式酒店服務提供商）的加入，顯著擴大了我們與全球粉絲群的互動。最後，PBR 為我們提供了額外的現場活動節目和媒體內容。總的來說，我們的組合產品組合使我們能夠吸引整個體育生態系統中的粉絲，從媒體消費到優質的現場賽事體驗。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The entertainment and sports services industries are highly competitive and subject to fluctuations in popularity, which are not easy to predict. For our live event and media content audiences, we face competition from professional and college sports (including other MMA promotions), scripted wrestling promotions, other live, filmed, televised, and streamed entertainment, as well as other leisure activities. We continue to face increased competition from websites, mobile, and other internet-connected apps delivering paid and free content as streamed media offerings continue to expand.","zh":"娛樂和體育服務業競爭激烈，人氣波動較大，不易預測。對於我們的現場活動和媒體內容觀眾來說，我們面臨著來自職業和大學體育（包括其他 MMA 促銷活動）、有腳本的摔角促銷活動、其他現場、電影、電視和串流媒體娛樂以及其他休閒活動的競爭。隨著串流媒體產品的不斷擴展，我們繼續面臨來自網站、行動裝置和其他提供付費和免費內容的網路連線應用程式的日益激烈的競爭。"},{"en":"With the addition of the IMG business and On Location, we now also compete in the highly fragmented markets for sports representation and experiential hospitality. We face competition from other global sports marketing agencies and premium hospitality providers that compete for rights holders and corporate clients.","zh":"隨著 IMG 業務和 On Location 業務的加入，我們現在也正在高度分散的體育代理和體驗式酒店市場中競爭。我們面臨來自其他全球體育行銷機構和優質飯店服務提供者的競爭，他們爭奪權利持有者和企業客戶。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"World Wrestling Entertainment","val":1709395000,"zh":"世界摔角娛樂部門"},{"name":"Ultimate Fighting Championship","val":1502161000,"zh":"終極格鬥冠軍賽部門"},{"name":"IMG","val":1367259000,"zh":"IMG部門"}],"total":4735151000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Media Rights Production & Content","val":2605116000,"zh":"媒體版權製作與內容"},{"name":"Live Events & Hospitality","val":1339456000,"zh":"現場活動及招待"},{"name":"Partnerships & Marketing","val":588516000,"zh":"合作夥伴與行銷"},{"name":"Consumer Products Licensing & Other","val":244789000,"zh":"消費品許可及其他"}],"total":4735151000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":3514848000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":898150000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":241672000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Latin America","val":80481000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"}],"total":4735151000}},"peers":["SPHR","FLUT","FWONK","MSGS","CART"]}}